  unitName: Holy Thrud (EU)
  unitId: 740114
  unitNumber: 7030
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Fighting amongst the warriors,
    and bringing the best of them to heaven, Thrud is ever faithful to her vows.
    The powers of her father, the god of thunder, have never been so raging through
    her.
  summonDesc: Do you hear the thunder? Could you lift my hammer?
  fusionDesc: Watch this! Hammer, lend me your strength!
  evoDesc: My hammer has never been this light! I feel strong!
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
